       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've also added significant optimization improvements across various aspects of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope you continue to enjoy CANINE! If so, please don't hesitate to leave a review. It really helps us keep going.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
